### 1. Crea Diego
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Diego" }

### 2. Crea Anna
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Anna" }

### 3. Diego crea una stanza
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "creatorId": 1 }

### 4. Anna entra (metti il codice che ti ha restituito la richiesta 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/XMF8HI/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2 }

### 5. Diego riprova a entrare nella sua stanza
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/XMF8HI/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1 }